          <p>My bread and butter is Photoshop, Illustrator, and After Effects. I work end-to-end from initial concept to print-ready production files, collaborating with cross-functional teams to maintain brand consistency across just about every touchpoint! Whether it be digital, print, or environmental creative, I can adapt and contribute effectively when working in a team environment.</p>
          <p>I have experience leading teams and managing projects as well. <br> The displayed projects DO NOT use generative AI.</p>
        </div>
